Z||000000||Formula||03-19-2000||01:58 PM||||as some of you may know, I have just purchased a Blue fastback GT.  It was not orginally blue so its not rare at all.  I was thinking about putting a white vinyl Grand Sport stripe and the red slashes on the side, what do you guys think?  has anyone seen a fiero GT with the grandsport style paint?  BTW, the corvette grandsport.||||reg||1
Z||000001||87ECO5||03-19-2000||02:59 PM||||Hmmm ... the GS scheme, eh?<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1996GS.jpg"> <P>Interesting idea.  Are you planning to repaint the GT in Admiral Blue or simply add the white and red decals over the existing paint?  I know Admiral Blue is a really deep blue.  The red hash marks contrast well with it.  I'm not sure how they would look with the Fiero blue.<P>Also, have you considered the amount of flack you'll get from the Vette folks?    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||fiero56||03-19-2000||03:24 PM||||Last summer I saw an '87-'88 coupe with the G/S paint scheme here in town. I think the owner worked at Best Buy as it was in their lot almost every day. This car had been completly repainted to match the Corvette exaclty. Looked VERY nice, all it needed was a set of G/S wheels to finish it off.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Formula||03-19-2000||04:37 PM||||My GT is already a deeper blue then factory.  I was planning on having it done in vinyl on the existing paint job.  I want it to turn as many heads as possible and I think this would be the way to go.<P>I was for flak from vette owners......<P>Fieros RULE, corvettes DROOL.||||reg||1
Z||000004||GT Bastard||03-19-2000||05:01 PM||||I saw a Firebird with that colors scheme and thought it look nice.  I was thinking about doing the same only in a different color.  ||||reg||1
Z||000005||BluByYou||03-20-2000||04:07 PM||||I didn't do the 'grand sport' look, rather something more like Viper styling.  Anyway, I love my stripes.  The guy who did it for me was meticulous about the details around the nose and rear license plate cutout.  Very distinctive.  I'd say if you like that look, go for it - It's your car!  I would caution against the 'uniqueness' of it though.  I was pi$$ed to see a piece-of-crap-Ford-Ranger with dual stripes on a metallic sky blue paint job ...... right after I had mine done.  Stripes have really cropped up all over northern Indiana.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Monkeyman||03-20-2000||10:15 PM||||IMHO, I think the Grand Sport paint scheme is ugly, but I suppose there are some who don't like the paint on the Grape Ape, either.||||reg||1
